      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Steam Ammo Press is your first GregGuns machine. It runs on steam like GregTech\u0027s other bronze machines and presses ammunition from loose parts, so you can load a stack of cobblestone and walk away. One run makes twenty-four Stone Bullets, eight more than hand crafting.\n\nIts recipe is hand-crafted: three small bronze pipes, two pistons, a bronze hull and three bronze plates. Feed it steam from any side except the front; it vents steam out of the front after every run.\n\nA steam press can run any Ammo Press recipe up to LV, only at half the speed of an electric machine. That means you can start making 9mm bullets before you have a single volt, if you have the brass and lead.\n\n[note]The press has its own recipe tab in NEI. Check it for every recipe it runs.[/note]",
